  "description": "The Horizon SUV 20 is a versatile e-trekking bike designed for touring and everyday convenience. High-quality LED lights enhance visibility, and the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility makes transporting accessories or a child seat simple. A trailer can also be attached for added hauling capability.\n\nAn adjustable stem allows you to customize your riding position, SP Connect makes it easy to mount your phone, and the dropper seat post supports easy height adjustment and mounting. Wide trekking tires provide reliable grip and comfort on mixed surfaces, while full fenders protect you from spray. With 120 mm of suspension travel and a dependable 10-speed drivetrain, it handles long days and varied terrain with ease.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line CX motor delivers strong support, and the removable 720Wh PowerTube battery gives you ample range for extended rides. Add optional extras like a Bosch PowerMore battery for increased range, while with the Bosch Smart System and eBike Flow App, you can check your bike's data, find advanced connectivity features and any available upgrades.",
